      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately, I don't think you're ready to become an Acolyte yet. Please finish learning all of the Basic Skills first.",
      "translation" : "很遗憾，我认为你还没准备好成为服事者。请先学会所有基本技能。"
